{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Recheck scope fatals after end-hook dispatch.** The only check occurs before `onInvocationEnd`. If a blocking end hook lets the handler owner report `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`, `execute()` can still return PENDING/RETRYING despite observing the fatal before the Lambda response. Recheck `scopeFatal` after dispatch without invoking hooks again, and update the late-dispatch regression to expect the original fatal.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77FuaC","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":453,"observation_digest":"5223d146c137bbd3d30b382e1c3d29b1bbf64e59a2945eb960a0863dd9d1b6d7","observation_id":"aro_v1_kir5crwbg655huylhaxbypjjwg","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-07T22:18:10Z","review_id":"arr_v1_qpclvzwkqhvz4kcbd5bbfcpoao","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"641458a1603099bf77822fa18bfe7c19e42edd6c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":453,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_7ymiwf3v7x4ratere7vwujhsl4","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T22:18:10Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
